{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "080f27a79ba19bb45998179aceb012b402f61138a22ed6277a4d0890ac296596", "ja": "（昨日と今日はやよいのグラビア撮影だ。結構遅くまで\n撮っていたけど……今日の調子はどうかな）", "zh": "（昨天和今天都是弥生的写真拍摄。虽然拍到了挺晚……不知道她今天状态怎么样）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "a0fa7b84034686ff41b3ea8a6c67f395c530179f31eccea6cacbb8f416d768c3", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nおはようございまーす！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n早上好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5a794d8a9a6737b0aa21e6e1fb362ecb1f775810d1ee0ad251eaa8b0dde0ca66", "ja": "おっ、やよい。おはよう。\nゆうべはよく眠れたかな？", "zh": "哦，弥生。早上好。\n昨晚睡得好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "f4ea957ba2ab41f80d1684b49b47bcc3d73f43d84f21ea6c8de0e99408b151cd", "ja": "はい！　ぐっすりして、\nスッキリしましたー！　えへへ。", "zh": "是的！睡得很香，精神也变好了——！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1ddd324ce8df5dc95e601baa25c7314bcb6d0bfd08400d0ceb9dad1aad7d5980", "ja": "うん。たしかにスッキリした、いい笑顔だ。\n撮影もあと少し、今日もいい写真が撮れそうだな。", "zh": "嗯。确实神清气爽，笑容很棒呢。\n拍摄也只剩一点了，看来今天也能拍出好照片啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "eb541a0308aa988f001e8bb7c1a052cbdbb64e71af3936c464e9e3cbca48cb2e", "ja": "それが終わったら、帰らなきゃなんですよね。\nなんだかちょっと、さみしいかもですー。", "zh": "等这些结束后，就得回去了吧。\n总觉得……好像有点寂寞呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "6092c69bfaf4cfa327138ff003afdac73b16e96f570bad6ed122f9aaecb493fc", "ja": "ゆうべはあんまり見られなかったですけど、\nここって、まわりの景色もいいですね。", "zh": "昨晚没怎么看清，\n不过这里的周边景色也很棒呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1007_p", "source_sha256": "181990a19b7c870115f0d09cf2c728841f31ca4d91317d6940813dfaee331129", "ja": "そっか。ゆっくり見る余裕、なかったよな。\n昨日は撮影、大変だったろう。", "zh": "这样啊。确实没什么时间好好欣赏。\n昨天拍摄一定很辛苦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "7649b62b751e8feee011db14cbe9be65770e50eced98db547b2ceb2f7fa6f5fb", "ja": "あ、そうですね。ちょっぴり悩んじゃいました。\nいつもの元気でーって、撮影を始めたんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，是呢。我稍微烦恼了一下。\n我本来想用平时的活力——开始拍摄的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "1a821508ea4b8ceb9e873a3f2bebf71dbeeb5bf9d9ee5b19e89099ec172ec167", "ja": "元気だけじゃなくて、もっとフンイキのある感じも\n欲しいって言われて……どうすればいいかなって。", "zh": "对方说，不只是要有精神，还想要更有氛围感的感觉……我就想着，该怎么办才好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "54d1f85767f44f41d2702b6ca2643ae476e82a52728372de5b8000aab545e89a", "ja": "ああ……。フンイキって言われても、結構\nつかみどころないもんな。", "zh": "啊……就算说是“氛围”，也挺让人摸不着头脑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "bd25d02cc52f398b6843fbd303bbd1977a64a3c0deb646be375b92e0c1dbc827", "ja": "だけど夜になって、なんとなく空の星を見て、今頃\nうちではみんなどうしてるかなーって思ってたら……。", "zh": "可是到了晚上，不经意间抬头看着天上的星星，想着“这时候家里大家都在做什么呢——”，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "5eab3eaa98a743eaeb09c49f96d8e1feeddc17cf11a13aa898c4275fafd96318", "ja": "カメラマンさんが、\n「それです！　そのフンイキいただきます！」って！", "zh": "摄影师说：\n“就是这个！我就要这种氛围！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "62ca4dac3a5b882e10fa45122d389313ad01a08808883a39689209308e048dec", "ja": "そうそう。その、空を見るフンイキでOKが出たな。\nいい感じだったぞ、やよい。", "zh": "对对，就是这样。那种仰望天空的感觉通过了。\n表现得很不错哦，弥生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "ff905a42adda035f578a24f4abe684849b9e1dee9533fb85892d899d9fb05217", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございまーす♪　フンイキって、\nそんなに難しく考えなくてもよかったんですねー♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您♪原来所谓的氛围，不用想得那么复杂也可以呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "9bd0417f740a85aff425712c5634ab84e1468c795cae25baa97d93be0c90e8e0", "ja": "私、またこの場所でお仕事できるとうれしいですっ。\n{$P$}……どうですか？", "zh": "能再次在这里工作的话，我会很开心的。\n{$P$}……您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1c2d420a1922c74abe4b4f9e82bc7e03a1482fbbbc317f878f774823eb2dcc97", "ja": "ああ、また来よう。仕事ではもちろん……、\n家族とか劇場のみんなと、遊びに来てもいいかもな。", "zh": "啊，下次再来吧。工作时当然可以……  \n也可以和家人或者剧场的大家一起来玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "e38344dc9e364ddd5d1256d5e556a60dfb3acb040d541cba98d8fe4574a06221", "ja": "ほんとですかっ！？　うっう～！\n私、ほんとに楽しみにしちゃいますよ！", "zh": "真的吗！？呜呜～！\n我真的会很期待的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e40f4892aa344c1f6201d6f8a74457977266cb48ad99ee269c1c710e8578400b", "ja": "ははは……約束だ。また来よう。\n……っとその前に、まずは今日も撮影よろしくな。", "zh": "哈哈……约好了。下次还来吧。\n……不过在那之前，今天的拍摄也拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0223_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "989e4d1781f660c0544cb40b250ba1f44fac178a4b0b2920489c7e2bbad91d70", "ja": "はいっ、約束です！　それじゃあ、今日も\nいいフンイキで、がんばってきますねっ。いぇい♪", "zh": "好的，约好了！那今天也要保持好氛围，加油拍摄哦。耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
